    "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"8124\" class=\"elementor elementor-8124\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-e4a28fd elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-stretched elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"84182\" data-id=\"e4a28fd\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;stretch_section&quot;:&quot;section-stretched&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-dd89e42\" data-eae-slider=\"54008\" data-id=\"dd89e42\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-15002c5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"15002c5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Lakewood Common Law Marriage Attorney</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f5ec287 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f5ec287\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Clarity and security matter in every committed relationship.</b></p><p><b> </b>At The Drake Law Firm, we help couples in Lakewood understand their rights and obligations under Colorado’s common law marriage rules. Whether you are building a life together or facing a separation, our team provides clear, compassionate guidance so you can make informed decisions about your future.<b><br /></b></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ca6d345 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"ca6d345\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/contact-us/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Schedule Your Consultation Today</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-778b0aa elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"94225\" data-id=\"778b0aa\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-a632414\" data-eae-slider=\"16685\" data-id=\"a632414\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-94079a5 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"75507\" data-id=\"94079a5\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-159919a\" data-eae-slider=\"75863\" data-id=\"159919a\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-795385f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"795385f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Proudly Serving Lakewood Families</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0d754a9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0d754a9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Drake Law Firm serves clients across Lakewood, from historic Belmar to the quiet streets near Green Mountain. We know Colorado’s unique approach to common law marriage can raise questions for couples at every stage of their relationship. Our common law marriage attorneys  listen to your story, explain your options in plain language, and help you take the next step feeling clear, prepared, and in control.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c520a40 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c520a40\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Our Lakewood Common Law Marriage Attorneys Can Help With:</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-799ede2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"799ede2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We assist with every stage of a common law marriage, from confirming its existence to resolving property and parenting disputes.</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><b>Separation and Property Division</b><b><br /></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Protect your interests when ending a common law marriage, including how property, debt, and assets are divided.</span></p></td><td><p><b>Spousal Support</b><b><br /></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Determine whether spousal maintenance applies in your case and how it might be calculated.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Parental Rights</b><b><br /></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Clarify custody, parenting time, and decision-making responsibilities when children are involved.</span></p></td><td><p><b>Marital Agreements</b><b><br /></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Create agreements that set expectations and reduce future disputes, even in non-ceremonial marriages.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><table><tbody><tr><td><p><b>Establishing a Common Law Marriage</b><b><br /></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Know what legally qualifies as a common law marriage in Colorado and how it applies to your situation.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2ba15a5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2ba15a5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>Why Lakewood Families Choose the Drake Law Firm</b></h2><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We understand that no two relationships are alike. Our common law marriage attorney takes the time to hear your concerns, learn your priorities, and guide you toward solutions that reflect your goals. Whether your relationship is starting, changing, or ending, our approach is grounded in clarity, empathy, and respect</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c0667c7 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"c0667c7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/contact-us/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Talk to a Lakewood Common Law Marriage Attorney</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-96ef698 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"96ef698\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What’s the Next Step</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-add70b8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"add70b8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2><span style=\"color: #177f9f;\"> <b>1. Contact us or visit our Lakewood office.</b></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We’re here to listen and answer your questions.</span></p><h3><span style=\"color: #177f9f;\"><b>2. Share your situation.</b></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tell us about your relationship, concerns, and goals so we can understand what matters most to you.</span></p><h3><span style=\"color: #177f9f;\"><b>3. Learn your options.</b></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We’ll explain how Colorado’s common law marriage laws apply to you and what steps are available.</span></p><h3><span style=\"color: #177f9f;\"><b>4. Get a clear plan.</b></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Leave the conversation knowing exactly what will happen next and how we can help.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ed4b736 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ed4b736\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>Start With A Consultation On Common Law Marriage</b></h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6942fea elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6942fea\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Whether you want to confirm your marital status, protect your property, or prepare for the future, our Lakewood common law marriage attorneys are here to guide you every step of the way.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2208cc4 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"2208cc4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/contact-us/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Talk to The Drake Law Firm Today</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-454876f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"454876f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>Lakewood Common Law Marriage FAQs:</b></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-10e38a4 uael-faq-box-layout-yes align-at-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-uael-faq\" data-id=\"10e38a4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"uael-faq.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div id='uael-faq-wrapper-177' class=\"uael-faq-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"uael-faq-container uael-faq-layout-accordion\" data-layout=\"accordion\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"uael-accordion-c609286\" class=\"uael-faq-accordion\" role=\"tablist\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class= \"uael-accordion-title\" aria-expanded=\"false\" role=\"tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-accordion-icon uael-accordion-icon-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-angle-right\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-angle-up\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-question-c609286 uael-question-span\" tabindex=\"0\" id=\"uael-faq-1-6b064d8659696\">How do I know if I’m in a common law marriage in Colorado?</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"uael-accordion-content\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In Colorado, a common law marriage exists when both partners agree they are married and present themselves publicly as a married couple. This can include using the same last name, sharing bank accounts, filing joint taxes, or introducing each other as spouses. A common law marriage attorney in Lakewood, CO can help you evaluate your situation and determine whether the law recognizes your relationship.</span></p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"uael-accordion-f791b84\" class=\"uael-faq-accordion\" role=\"tablist\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class= \"uael-accordion-title\" aria-expanded=\"false\" role=\"tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-accordion-icon uael-accordion-icon-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-angle-right\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-angle-up\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-question-f791b84 uael-question-span\" tabindex=\"0\" id=\"uael-faq-2-6b064d86596dd\">Can a common law marriage be ended without a divorce?</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"uael-accordion-content\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No. Once a common law marriage is established in Colorado, it must be dissolved through the same court process as a ceremonial marriage. This includes dividing property, determining parental responsibilities, and resolving spousal maintenance. Working with a common law marriage attorney in Lakewood can make this process smoother and more predictable.</span></p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"uael-accordion-821bc76\" class=\"uael-faq-accordion\" role=\"tablist\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class= \"uael-accordion-title\" aria-expanded=\"false\" role=\"tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-accordion-icon uael-accordion-icon-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-angle-right\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-angle-up\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-question-821bc76 uael-question-span\" tabindex=\"0\" id=\"uael-faq-3-6b064d8659703\">Do I need to register my common law marriage?</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"uael-accordion-content\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There is no formal registration requirement in Colorado. However, couples sometimes sign an affidavit of common law marriage to use for benefits or official purposes. This can serve as evidence if the marriage is later questioned. A Lakewood common law marriage attorney can prepare or review this document with you.</span></p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"uael-accordion-be778bc\" class=\"uael-faq-accordion\" role=\"tablist\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class= \"uael-accordion-title\" aria-expanded=\"false\" role=\"tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-accordion-icon uael-accordion-icon-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-angle-right\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-angle-up\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-question-be778bc uael-question-span\" tabindex=\"0\" id=\"uael-faq-4-6b064d865972d\">What happens to property in a common law marriage separation?</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"uael-accordion-content\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Property acquired during the relationship is generally considered marital property, subject to equitable division by the court. This includes real estate, retirement accounts, vehicles, and debts. A common law marriage attorney in Lakewood can help protect your financial interests.</span></p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"uael-accordion-a702192\" class=\"uael-faq-accordion\" role=\"tablist\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class= \"uael-accordion-title\" aria-expanded=\"false\" role=\"tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-accordion-icon uael-accordion-icon-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-angle-right\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-angle-up\"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"uael-question-a702192 uael-question-span\" tabindex=\"0\" id=\"uael-faq-5-6b064d8659763\">Can I get spousal support after ending a common law marriage?</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"uael-accordion-content\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes, spousal maintenance (alimony) is available under the same conditions as a formal marriage. The court looks at factors like income differences, length of the marriage, and each party’s ability to be self-supporting. Speaking with a common law marriage attorney in Lakewood, CO will help you understand what applies in your case.</span></p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2f8a307\" data-eae-slider=\"54325\" data-id=\"2f8a307\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-974a12a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"48639\" data-id=\"974a12a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-d805dec\" data-eae-slider=\"74482\" data-id=\"d805dec\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-746c3e7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-template\" data-id=\"746c3e7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"template.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-template\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"page\" data-elementor-id=\"852\" class=\"elementor elementor-852\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-sect